# Stmt: Witness.WitnessExistFact with exist! uniqueness
# Run: litex -f examples/new_pipeline/stmt_nodes/witness/witness_exist_unique_fact.lit
#
# Body `x = 0` forces uniqueness: any two witnesses equal to 0 are equal.
# No indented proof body; ambient builtin equality closes the uniqueness forall.

witness exist! x R st {x = 0} from 0
exist! x R st {x = 0}
